\fs32\b About WinBMD2\b0\fs20\par
\par
WinBMD2 is a transcription program designed for volunteers contributing to the FreeBMD project.\par
\par
It provides facilities for transcribing entries from images of the General Register Office indexes, checking the completed transcription against the original scan, and uploading the finished transcription to FreeBMD.\par
\par
\fs24\b FreeBMD\b0\fs20\par
FreeBMD is a volunteer project providing free access to transcriptions of the civil registration indexes of births, marriages and deaths for England and Wales.\par
\par
Further information about FreeBMD can be found at:\par
\par
https://www.freebmd.org.uk/\par
\par
